---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoEscapeAnalysisDemo from '../demos/GoEscapeAnalysisDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gead-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: Go compiler escape analysis (-gcflags='-m=2') vs stack allocation" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: Phân tích thoát Stack của compiler (-gcflags='-m=2') vs cấp phát Heap">
    <GoEscapeAnalysisDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Step through four common escape triggers in cmd/compile (returned pointer, interface any boxing, dynamic make slice, and closure capture) alongside their zero-allocation fixes.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm từng bước qua bốn nguyên nhân đẩy biến lên Heap phổ biến nhất trong trình biên dịch Go (trả con trỏ, đóng hộp any, make động, và closure) cùng cách sửa về Stack 0 cấp phát.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gead-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gead-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gead-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gead .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gead .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gead .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gead .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gead-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gead-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gead-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gead-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gead-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gead-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gead-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .gead-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gead-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gead-note p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .gead-badge {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;
    padding: 9px 11px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
  }
  .gead-badge span { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gead-badge b { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .gead-badge code { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gead-badge.is-ok { border-color: rgb(21, 128, 61); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gead-badge.is-ok { border-color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gead-badge.is-bad { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); }
</style>
